      <common:UUID>22024336-9564-4516-8a68-bf70ccb3d42c</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Nougat, Production and disposal of 1 kg of nougat, packaging included</baseName>
        <treatmentStandardsRoutes> Production and disposal of 1 kg of nougat</treatmentStandardsRoutes>
        <mixAndLocationTypes> Packaging included</mixAndLocationTypes>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Torrone</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Food and renewable raw materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>The dataset has been developed in LIFE EFFIGE project. Details are given in “PEFCR of Nougat”. In a cradle to grave approach, the dataset includes the all input and output for the production of 1 kg of nougat at the consumer, including its packaging and the end of life of the packaging materials.</common:generalComment>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2018</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2024</common:dataSetValidUntil>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT"/>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset includes the model of the production 1 kg of nougat at the consumer, including the end of life of its packaging materials.&#13;
The following life cycle phases are included :&#13;
Inputs production – agricultural stage&#13;
Production – cooking stage&#13;
Production – packaging stage&#13;
Distribution Chain&#13;
Use&#13;
End of Life</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
